      "id": "claim_a6266488cdd74d1593a0edc0d645b7b9",
      "statement": "IRRBB at MHFC is measured with two lenses, an earnings-based NII metric and a value-based EVE metric, both produced by the Tier 1 model MDL-ALM-014 (Net Interest Income Sensitivity Model), which feeds Annual Report market-risk and Pillar 3 IRRBB disclosures.",
