      "statement": "MDL-ALM-014 is owned by Corporate Treasury - Asset & Liability Management, independently validated by MRGR (last 2025-09-18, next due 2026-09-30), and its outputs are reviewed monthly by ALCO; Treasury/CIO manages structural rate risk via the securities portfolio and interest rate derivatives within Board Risk Committee limits.",
