      "statement": "Board Risk Committee limits (approved 2025-03) are NII decline no greater than 7.0% of base NII and EVE decline no greater than 15.0% of Tier 1 capital; the Summary sheet flags BREACH only when the change is below the negative limit, so increases are never flagged, and limit values are Assumptions-sheet inputs.",
